 linuxmuster-linbo7 - linuxmuster-linbo7
Changes:
 linuxmuster-linbo7 (7.4.17) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(linbo_remote_lib): make isValidIpv4() a pure syntax check - the
     octet-based .0/.255 "network"/"broadcast" heuristic was only correct
     by coincidence for /24 subnets, wrongly rejecting valid host addresses
     in larger subnets (#174, 6805dc2).
   * fix(rsync-pre-download.sh): merge per-image status lines again instead
     of overwriting <host>_image.status on every sync, which discarded every
     other image's entry since 13ff562 (#171, 235231d).
